  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ええっ……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん？\r\nふゆ、もうすぐ本番なんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800602/2018006020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "この水着のよさをちゃんと表現できるかなって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800602/2018006020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "みんなにちゃんと『綺麗』って思ってもらえるかなって、\r\n不安で……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800602/2018006020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そんな状態の担当アイドルに、\r\nさっきみたいな言葉をかけるのは正解ですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800602/2018006020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、そ、そういうことか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、すまん──！\r\nすごく似合ってる──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "いい、いい\r\n今さら何言ったって遅いから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800602/2018006020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それとね、似合ってるってことぐらい知ってんの\r\nふゆはあんたのぼんくら具合を言ってるわけ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201800602/2018006020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018006020100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたが相手にしてるのは、あんたの会社の商品よ\r\nもうちょっと扱い方に気を遣って",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
